<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post624837021645899635..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Truce of God</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>13</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7258782443938307565</id><published>2009-12-29T03:15:29.123-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-29T03:15:29.123-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;Finally, a word about Obama&amp;#39;s troo...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Finally, a word about Obama&amp;#39;s troop surge in Afghanistan, the latest saga in our endless wars.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here is another video, in which a former Russian Lieutenant-General talks about his experiences in Afghanistan:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://vodpod.com/watch/2739833-afghanistan-war-the-soviet-lesson-not-learned?mp=1&amp;amp;pod=peterchamberlin&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;He says the Soviets won 90% of their battles, and there was not one inch of territory that their 500,000 soldiers (vs. our 130,000) did not conquer, but in the end they lost the hearts of the Afghan people and the war, not having succeeded in holding a single inch of ground at all.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Their Afghan War brought down the Soviet Empire. If we keep on with our own insanity, I believe Afghanistan will bring down the American Empire also. God help us and the rest of the world when that happens. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Who knows what worldwide economic, political and ecological chaos might result when Pax Americana collapses? Another barbaric and savage Dark Ages like what followed the collapse of Rome? God only knows.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/7258782443938307565'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/7258782443938307565'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1262081729123#c7258782443938307565' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97890152"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2009 at 3:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4553847050663365989</id><published>2009-12-29T02:50:30.098-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-29T02:50:30.098-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;The last time I wrote here, I made sta...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The last time I wrote here, I made statements about the origins of 9-11-2001, the pretext for this eternal war which is claiming the lives of our youth and vast amounts of our treasure. Some people took exception to my claims and called me sick in the head.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here is one more piece of evidence: a video from the BBC (a reliable source, I think,) which reveals that &amp;quot;Al Qaeda&amp;quot; never existed, which I also stated in my posting, but is a fictitious organization invented by the FBI and USGOV in January 2001:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://vodpod.com/watch/2018226-bbc-now-admits-al-qaeda-never-existed?mp=1&amp;amp;pod=peterchamberlin&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The term &amp;quot;Al Qaeda&amp;quot; was the Arabic name of the CIA database of Afghan Mujahedeen fighting the Soviets in Afghanistan in the 1980&amp;#39;s. It was resurrected by a witness (who had stolen money from Osama Bin Laden) in the Embassy Bombings court case in New York in January 2001, and used to designate Bin Laden&amp;#39;s fictitious terrorist network.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As I said in my prior post, 9-11 was planned and organized right here in the USA, using Islamic fundamentalist Saudi dissidents as hijackers (whom the Saudi government was probably only too happy to have them kill themselves,) with the understanding that Osama, the black sheep of the Bin Laden Family, (bosom pals and business partners of the Bush Family,) would be the fall guy.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Just like the Nazi Holocaust, of which no documentary evidence has ever come to light, it is very likely that no proof of the Bush Family&amp;#39;s and their friends&amp;#39; complicity in 9-11 will ever be found. But it is the only thing which makes perfect sense of all the events of that dreadful day.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Not only that, but the Bush plotters fabricated links between this fictitious &amp;quot;Al Qaeda&amp;quot; and Saddam Hussein in order to embroil this nation in a war to topple him. The US motive was to seize Iraqi oil for Mr. Cheney&amp;#39;s and Poppy Bush&amp;#39;s friends, and the Israeli payoff for co-operating in the 9-11 plot was our elimination of Saddam for them, while spending our money and our sons&amp;#39; lives. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We were then supposed to eliminate the ayatollahs in Iran for the very same reasons.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unfortunately, not only did the 9-11 plot ultimately fail because the plane which went down in Pennsylvania never hit the Capitol as it was supposed to do, thereby opening the way for a Presidential dictatorship, but also because the Iraqi people refused to allow us to steal their oil. Trillions of dollars and almost a million deaths later, absolutely nothing has been achieved. Our economy is in ruins, our bleeding military is reduced to buying off our enemies, Israel is in a far more dangerous position than before, and all that Iraqi oil remains in the ground because the resistance keeps blowing up the pipelines.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As I keep saying, be of good cheer, for God will not be mocked. Lies, theft and murder will never produce good results, as the German people learned too late in 1945. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Those who take up the sword will perish by the sword.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/4553847050663365989'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/4553847050663365989'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1262080230098#c4553847050663365989' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97890152"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2009 at 2:50 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5927693041075557547</id><published>2009-12-29T02:12:02.816-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-29T02:12:02.816-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;I was aware of this event in 1914, but ...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;I was aware of this event in 1914, but did not know all these details. Thank you for a wonderful exposition of this amazing moment of history.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Fellow readers,&lt;br /&gt;To bring Mr. Grigg&amp;#39;s essay into a modern perspective, PLEASE go to this video below, of a speech by a young US soldier returned from IRAQ, speaking before a meeting of Iraq Veterans Against the War:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://vodpod.com/watch/2738558-amazing-speech-by-war-veteran?mp=1&amp;amp;pod=peterchamberlin&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is most eloquent. I wish I had a transcript I could post for you to read, but in any case his voice, close to tears, is even more powerful.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you, and have a better year in 2010 than this one was.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Sincerely,&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/5927693041075557547'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/5927693041075557547'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1262077922816#c5927693041075557547' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97890152"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2009 at 2:12 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5121117121251080045</id><published>2009-12-27T12:49:05.688-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-27T12:49:05.688-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;ve been studying the origins of WWI for over...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;ve been studying the origins of WWI for over ten years now and have yet to find any rhyme or reason for the madness except that very evil men wanted to make their fortunes off of the slaughter.  Why the men in the trenches didn&amp;#39;t turn their guns 180 degrees and shoot the real enemy is the puzzling thing.  Such is the power of the state to beguile the sheeple. If men would only refuse to be pawns of the power elite.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/5121117121251080045'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/5121117121251080045'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1261943345688#c5121117121251080045' title=''/><author><name>whitebuffalo</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03538355208030340243</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-254268918"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2009 at 12:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8954846358858008122</id><published>2009-12-26T08:46:36.825-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-26T08:46:36.825-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Then, as today, the malice is in the hearts of the...</title><content type='html'>Then, as today, the malice is in the hearts of the leaders, not residing in the heart of the common man.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;History reveals the consequences of picking leaders poorly and is on display for anyone to see unless willingly blind.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Today we have leaders picked poorly and the majority of the citizenry is willingly blind.  The results are predictable.  Look around you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/8954846358858008122'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/8954846358858008122'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1261842396825#c8954846358858008122' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-516418016"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 26, 2009 at 8:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5807574081866316017</id><published>2009-12-26T00:14:24.610-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-26T00:14:24.610-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Amen, amen, amen.&#xa;&#xa;American Countrey Music has mem...</title><content type='html'>Amen, amen, amen.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;American Countrey Music has memorialozed this most sacred of events -- &lt;a href=&quot;http://orientem.blogspot.com/2009/12/collin-raye-sings-it-could-happen-again.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Collin Raye Sings &amp;quot;It Could Happen Again&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/5807574081866316017'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/5807574081866316017'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1261811664610#c5807574081866316017' title=''/><author><name>The Western Confucian</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17888802647534998598</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='21' height='32' src='http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2288/1588344018_529ec96f69_t.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1029344060"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 26, 2009 at 12:14 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-887748453345719916</id><published>2009-12-25T23:30:42.501-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-25T23:30:42.501-07:00</updated><title type='text'>A very nice reminder on this Christmas night.&#xa;&#xa;To ...</title><content type='html'>A very nice reminder on this Christmas night.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;To you and all of your regulars&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Merry Christmas&lt;br /&gt;Happy Holidays&lt;br /&gt;and the best to all who in Liberty unite here&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Enjoy your family, friends and neighbors - as Will has shown, Leviathan can wait for another day.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And Will, my thoughts are with you and your brother.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In Male Fide&lt;br /&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/887748453345719916'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/887748453345719916'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1261809042501#c887748453345719916' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1196059531"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 25, 2009 at 11:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2230297881782544109</id><published>2009-12-25T17:14:14.482-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-25T17:14:14.482-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon @ 2:38 and 2:59 -- &#xa;&#xa;Donkey shane, and gooten...</title><content type='html'>Anon @ 2:38 and 2:59 -- &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Donkey shane, and gooten on bend! j/k.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/2230297881782544109'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/2230297881782544109'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1261786454482#c2230297881782544109' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-624837021645899635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/624837021645899635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 25, 2009 at 5:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3852354229301380358</id><published>2009-12-25T17:10:06.015-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-25T17:10:06.015-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Amazing isn&amp;#39;t it.  Today we do business with p...</title><content type='html'>Amazing isn&amp;#39;t it.  Today we do business with people we once bombed mercilessly (the Vietnamese).  So what was the point of all that?  Today we do likewise to others who have never raised their hand in anger to any one of us and perhaps we may one day clasp our hands in friendship and respect instead.  What a different kind of world we would all live in where we to simply silence the voices of death that pretend to be our leaders.  If they are so hell bent on killing someone they can go over there and do it all by themselves and on their individual dime to boot.  Everyone else can have a bite of chocolate, smoke a cig, or play a game of football.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/3852354229301380358'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/624837021645899635/comments/default/3852354229301380358'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/truce-of-god.html?showComment=1261786206015#c3852354229301380358' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns